Sokha reads the news every morning on a news website. Today there is breaking news on the front page: a new bridge has opened. A reporter is talking to an interview guest on TV. Sokha reads an article about young Cambodian athletes. He also checks the weather report. He wants to write a journalist report for the school magazine.

